<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 32.4650 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 32.4650 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell 17 basis points to 32.4650 percent on Monday, from 32.6350 percent on Friday, banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is revised weekly.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289558</p>
